{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00722","headline":"郊庙歌辞 让皇帝庙乐章 迎俎 · 李舒","name":"郊庙歌辞 让皇帝庙乐章 迎俎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祀盛体荐，礼协粢盛。\n方周假庙，用鲁纯牲。\n捧彻祗敬，击拊和鸣。\n受厘归胙，既戒而平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李舒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}